{"id":"658122","name":"番茄蘑菇炖牛肉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658122/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"800g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蘑菇","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄洗净去掉皮。","img":"images/658122/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"橄榄油热以后，放入汆烫过的牛肉块翻炒，加入姜片去腥。","img":"images/658122/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"番茄切成块。","img":"images/658122/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"番茄放入牛肉里翻炒。","img":"images/658122/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水烧开。","img":"images/658122/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蘑菇去掉头洗净。","img":"images/658122/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一个蘑菇切成四块。","img":"images/658122/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入番茄里翻炒，加入冰糖烧1小时。","img":"images/658122/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"焖烧1小时候，加入盐调味。","img":"images/658122/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/658122/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"牛肉软糯，番茄酸甜可口。","img":"images/658122/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}